  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LAND-at-scale Colombia: Booster - Simplifying Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This funding aims to improve land administration processes in rural Colombia through the legal and regulatory application of the simplified FFP (Fit for Purpose) methodology by the Colombian authorities. The activities build on previous work by Kadaster International (KI) in the Land-In-Peace (LiP) and LAND-at-scale (LAS) projects in Colombia and are seen as a booster. The project addresses these needs through two pillars: 1)	The definition and support for the implementation of a Sandbox to demonstrate more efficient land formalisation procedures, and 2)	Indigenous land management to scale up current lessons learned and take the necessary next steps for greater impact on formalisation procedures for indigenous communities and embedding in government organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
